; redis — a Redis client over RESP2 (ROADMAP-http.md, stage C: the L2 cache
; of the production-stack profile): commands sent as arrays of bulk
; strings, one reply read per command, and a pool of connections per
; scheduler thread. The modules, in dependency order: the byte buffer, the
; connection, the pool.
;
; A connection is a TcpStream like any other, so a command parks its task
; on the runtime's evented I/O and the scheduler runs other requests
; meanwhile.

package scaly 0.1.0

define redis
{
    module Buf
    module Conn
    module Pool
}
